<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post8202662116729128299..comments</id><updated>2016-09-21T13:36:13.249-05:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Sipsey Street Irregulars: Not in my name: A Georgia III% group manages to conjure up every single negative stereotype of the Patriot movement</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='https://billstclair.com/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/8202662116729128299/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2016/09/not-in-my-name-georgia-iii-group.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><link rel='next' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/8202662116729128299/comments/default?start-index=26&amp;max-results=25'/><author><name>Dutchman6</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/09935420042995679958</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='32' src='http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-0dD3DfcQ3v8/Ub55cPMr2YI/AAAAAAAAXDw/9jlWvTVN5nw/s220/vanderboeghsmuggler.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>34</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-1056485253242990152</id><published>2016-09-16T22:47:28.124-05:00</published><updated>2016-09-16T22:47:28.124-05:00</updated><title type='text'>Matt,&#xa;&#xa;I just want to be clear, are you saying tha...</title><content type='html'>Matt,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I just want to be clear, are you saying that ANY association with white supremacists is repugnant to the III%? Even when that association is second hand (a friend of a friend or what seems to be the case here, someone defending another groups 1st ammendment rights)?&lt;br /&gt;And can you demonstrate the intent of the III% &amp;#39;catechism&amp;#39; that disavows any such &amp;#39;code of conduct&amp;#39;?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I&amp;#39;m new to the III and would like your input on these issues.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Tenderfoot</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/8202662116729128299/comments/default/1056485253242990152'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/8202662116729128299/comments/default/1056485253242990152'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2016/09/not-in-my-name-georgia-iii-group.html?showComment=1474084048124#c1056485253242990152' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2016/09/not-in-my-name-georgia-iii-group.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-8202662116729128299' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/8202662116729128299' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1360093517"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 16, 2016 at 10:47 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-3818585781017743799</id><published>2016-09-16T11:34:51.808-05:00</published><updated>2016-09-16T11:34:51.808-05:00</updated><title type='text'>If GSF was a fine example of a &amp;quot;true militia&amp;...</title><content type='html'>If GSF was a fine example of a &amp;quot;true militia&amp;quot;, it would not be on this discussion. If Hill was a fine example of a leader, there wouldn&amp;#39;t be a GSF/ Hill and Kessler survivors club that actually has nearly 3 times as many members than GSF does, he would still be leading us all. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;If you think armed protests of every government action you can pervert, playing Rambo in the woods, making youtube videos, and declaring wars against governments and ISIS makes you a fine example of a true Militia, and the rest of us are snowflakes because we don&amp;#39;t &amp;quot;youtube&amp;quot;, then you cannot possibly begin to understand the problems with in your own organization. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Dude, Most of us Rambo. Many of us are highly active. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;We KNOW you&amp;#39;re active. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It&amp;#39;s your &amp;quot;activities&amp;quot; that put you in this conversation. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It is your activities that make you guys the punch line of a good joke in most Militia and Patriothe Communities. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It&amp;#39;s a shame, because you guys really could be great. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/8202662116729128299/comments/default/3818585781017743799'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/8202662116729128299/comments/default/3818585781017743799'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2016/09/not-in-my-name-georgia-iii-group.html?showComment=1474043691808#c3818585781017743799' title=''/><author><name>SO1RainMaker</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14755229594982421294</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2016/09/not-in-my-name-georgia-iii-group.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-8202662116729128299' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/8202662116729128299' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1782952462"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 16, 2016 at 11:34 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-6448293676683327809</id><published>2016-09-16T03:33:47.638-05:00</published><updated>2016-09-16T03:33:47.638-05:00</updated><title type='text'>Not in my name...&#xa;&#xa;Kerodin is that you again, or a...</title><content type='html'>Not in my name...&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Kerodin is that you again, or a new III% movement &amp;#39;owner&amp;#39;? &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;You might like the muzzys setting up shop in your neighborhood, we don&amp;#39;t. and if you had tsken the frigging time to research the incident before you opened your mouth, you wou;d have found that the commission had already gone behind closed doors in violation of sunshine laws, with ZERO public (as in the citizens of the county) and passed it with muzzy&amp;#39;s using false document names.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;If it was on the up and up, we wouldn&amp;#39;t be having this problem right now, would we?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The people in the COMMUNITY found out about it, got pissed at the deception, and are fighting back against it, guess in your eys they&amp;#39;re supposed to bow like little sheep to a system that is already stacked against them.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;You&amp;#39;re getting in the trenches on the wrong side of this fight, thought damn CAIR wrote your article.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;AOV</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' hr